<h2>Payment type on working capital loans</h2>
<p>Payment type is optional for monetary transactions on working capital loans. You can provide a payment type id, which the system assigns to the transaction and stores. You can fetch payment type details through the loan transaction details API.</p>
<h2>Delinquency and breach bucket overrides</h2>
<p>You can override the delinquency bucket and breach bucket configuration when you create a working capital loan. The loan level override takes effect instead of the product level default. Changing the repayment percentage updates how the system evaluates delinquency and breach for the loan.</p>
